      "content": "<callout type=\"note\">\n### [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suIDMiaB](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suIDMiaB)\n\n[https://vimeo.com/460336691](https://vimeo.com/460336691) — [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suFRcHo1](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suFRcHo1) Humanists, Sept 20, 2020 (uploaded Sept 21)  \nJeff LaLande discusses the reasons for the 160-year-long history of proposed secession movements to separate Southern Oregon and to form a new state with Northern California.\n\n-  \n</callout>\n\n\n\n<columns>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n|||\n\n[https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suM-62GQ](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suM-62GQ) \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n|||\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n|||\n\n[https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suQWY5DS](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suQWY5DS) \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</columns>",
